uality (2/2)\n70\tFive testable Given/When/Then acceptance criteria covering: new-install\n71\tdefault, upgrade preservation of explicitly configured values, culler\n72\tvalidation at the new default, admin UI override behavior, and the\n73\tdocumentation update. No rule-mandated ACs apply — this is not a replacement\n74\t(rollback/feature-flag), not a konflux-chain epic (build pipeline green), and\n75\tnot a docs-authoring epic (technical review). The epic body does not reference\n76\tsibling epics by draft ID.\n77\t\n78\t### 7. Completeness (2/2)\n79\tAll strategy scope is covered: the default change (HLR-1), the documentation\n80\tupdate (HLR-2), upgrade behavior, and passive-component validation. Out-of-scope\n81\titems (per-project/per-user culling policies, kernel probe changes) are\n82\texplicitly excluded in the epic. The strategy's \"Open Questions: None\" is\n83\thonored. No Prerequisites & Process Gates section exists in the strategy, so\n84\tno Documentation Support gate requires a separate docs-authoring epic; the\n85\tincidental doc update is covered as epic scope and an AC. Missing strategy\n86\tsections (teams table, NFRs, Given/When/Then) are flagged in the decomposition's\n87\thealth warnings rather than silently dropped.\n88\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-89368d82abfa11ae","agent_id":"a5560e5cffd63fcac","session_id":"20ba91d5-262e-4693-852d-b58d21401028","uuid":"54b48e3a-1ae5-460e-9f2c-ac7ea909b0e3","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:24:32.801Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a31c1b1f641b87c3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9003 decomposition"}
